  <TimeLineElement>
I am co-organizing a "Math C pour L" research school at <a class="link-secondary" href="https://lmb.univ-fcomte.fr/" target="_blank">LMB</a>. It is a national program introducing undergraduate women to mathematical research through group projects and interactions with researchers.
          </TimeLineElement>
<TimeLineElement>
        I was one of the organizers of a <a class="link-secondary" href="https://probabio-lmb.pages.math.cnrs.fr/events.html" target="_blank">one-day meeting in Besançon</a> on December 10th, 2024. The event was centered on stochastic models in biology, with a particular emphasis on epidemic modeling, populations under selection, and genealogies in interacting populations.  
          </TimeLineElement>
          <TimeLineElement>I was part of the organization team of <a class="link-secondary" href="https://ps-mathematik.univie.ac.at/e/index.php?event=mmee2024" target="_blank"> MMEE24</a>, Vienna in July 2024.

